  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A wire of resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>160</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8486;</mo></math>&nbsp;is melted and drawn in a wire of one-fourth of its length. The new resistance of the wire will be</p>"
  },
