  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The formula to calculate the resistance of the original wire is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>When the new wire is formed, its resistance is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Divide equation (2) by equation (1) and simplify to obtain the expression for the new resistance.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (3) to calculate the required new resistance.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>160</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>"
